This is the "Australian readnews", written by Michael Rourke at UNSW.It's a simple and reasonably well-put-together news reader suitable forgiving to naive users who aren't going to be reading news much.You'll need to fiddle defs.h for your machine, then type "make".Note that README.aus assumes you are installing the entire UNSW newssystem, not just readnews; some of it is inapplicable.